# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inspect and modify annotations {#inspect-and-modify-annotations}"
msgstr "Inspectează și modifică adnotările {#inspect-and-modify-annotations}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After auto-boxing, you might want to inspect the annotations on specific boxes or adjust them. For example, to add noise injection, remove annotations, or change a twirling group. Samplomatic provides a set of utility functions in [`samplomatic.utils`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/utils#module-samplomatic.utils \"samplomatic.utils\") for this purpose. All of them return a **new circuit** without modifying the original.\n"
msgstr "După auto-boxing, poate vrei să inspectezi adnotările de pe anumite box-uri sau să le ajustezi. De exemplu, pentru a adăuga injectare de zgomot, a elimina adnotări sau a schimba un grup de twirling. Samplomatic oferă un set de funcții utilitare în [`samplomatic.utils`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/utils#module-samplomatic.utils \"samplomatic.utils\") în acest scop. Toate returnează un **circuit nou**, fără a modifica originalul.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`extend_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-extend-annotations#samplomatic.utils.extend_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.extend_annotations\") appends one or more annotations to every box in the circuit.\n"
msgstr "[`extend_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-extend-annotations#samplomatic.utils.extend_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.extend_annotations\") adaugă una sau mai multe adnotări la fiecare box din circuit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`filter_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-filter-annotations#samplomatic.utils.filter_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.filter_annotations\") keeps only annotations of specified types, removing the rest. [`replace_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-replace-annotations#samplomatic.utils.replace_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.replace_annotations\") applies a callable to each annotation; the callable returns a list of annotations to substitute in its place (return `[]` to remove, a single-element list to replace, or a multi-element list to expand).\n"
msgstr "[`filter_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-filter-annotations#samplomatic.utils.filter_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.filter_annotations\") păstrează doar adnotările de tipurile specificate, eliminându-le pe celelalte. [`replace_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-replace-annotations#samplomatic.utils.replace_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.replace_annotations\") aplică un callable fiecărei adnotări; callable-ul returnează o listă de adnotări care să le înlocuiască (returnează `[]` pentru a elimina, o listă cu un singur element pentru a înlocui sau o listă cu mai multe elemente pentru a extinde).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The general-purpose [`map_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-map-annotations#samplomatic.utils.map_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.map_annotations\") function accepts any callable that maps a list of annotations to a new list, giving you full control over per-box transformations. [`strip_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-strip-annotations#samplomatic.utils.strip_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.strip_annotations\") is a convenience wrapper that removes all annotations from every box.\n"
msgstr "Funcția generală [`map_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-map-annotations#samplomatic.utils.map_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.map_annotations\") acceptă orice callable care transformă o listă de adnotări într-o listă nouă, oferindu-ți control deplin asupra transformărilor per box. [`strip_annotations()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/utils-strip-annotations#samplomatic.utils.strip_annotations \"samplomatic.utils.strip_annotations\") este un wrapper de conveniență care elimină toate adnotările de la fiecare box.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For bulk changes like adding [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") to all gate boxes, the `inject_noise_targets` parameter of [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") is the most concise option. These utilities are useful for selective per-box edits that the pass manager parameters do not cover.\n"
msgstr "Pentru modificări în masă, cum ar fi adăugarea [`InjectNoise`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/inject-noise#samplomatic.InjectNoise \"samplomatic.InjectNoise\") la toate box-urile de porți, parametrul `inject_noise_targets` al [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") este cea mai concisă opțiune. Aceste utilitare sunt utile pentru editări selective per box, pe care parametrii pass manager-ului nu le acoperă.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a circuit {#build-a-circuit}"
msgstr "Construiește un circuit {#build-a-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every pass manager produced by [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") returns circuits that can be successfully turned into a template/samplex pair by [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\"). For example, the following code calls the [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") function on a circuit produced by a boxing pass manager.\n"
msgstr "Fiecare pass manager produs de [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") returnează circuite care pot fi transformate cu succes într-o pereche template/samplex de către [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\"). De exemplu, codul următor apelează funcția [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") pe un circuit produs de un pass manager de boxing.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To ensure that any transpiled circuit can be successfully built, the pass managers know how to include additional boxes when they are needed. For example, consider the circuit below, which ends with an unmeasured qubit `0`.\n"
msgstr "Pentru a se asigura că orice circuit transpilat poate fi construit cu succes, pass manager-ele știu să includă box-uri suplimentare atunci când este nevoie. De exemplu, ia în considerare circuitul de mai jos, care se termină cu un qubit `0` nemăsurat.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![../\\_images/0452779799470d2deb4d32ce19f5aa28dfe8055a064e67c0e8e5684389845b0f.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/0452779799470d2deb4d32ce19f5aa28dfe8055a064e67c0e8e5684389845b0f.avif)\n"
msgstr "![../\\_images/0452779799470d2deb4d32ce19f5aa28dfe8055a064e67c0e8e5684389845b0f.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/0452779799470d2deb4d32ce19f5aa28dfe8055a064e67c0e8e5684389845b0f.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drawing left-dressed boxes around the gates and measurements would result in a circuit that has uncollected virtual gates on qubit `0`, and calling [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") on this circuit would result in an error. To avoid this, the pass managers returned by [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") can add right-dressed boxes to act as collectors. For example, in the following code, qubit `0` is terminated by a right-dressed box that picks up the uncollected virtual gate. The single-qubit gates acting on qubit `0` are also placed inside the box in order to minimize the depth of the resulting circuit.\n"
msgstr "Desenarea unor box-uri left-dressed în jurul porților și măsurătorilor ar produce un circuit cu porți virtuale necolectate pe qubitul `0`, iar apelarea [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") pe acest circuit ar duce la o eroare. Pentru a evita acest lucru, pass manager-ele returnate de [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") pot adăuga box-uri right-dressed care să acționeze drept colectoare. De exemplu, în codul următor, qubitul `0` este încheiat de un box right-dressed care preia poarta virtuală necolectată. Porțile cu un singur qubit care acționează asupra qubitului `0` sunt plasate și ele în interiorul box-ului, pentru a minimiza adâncimea circuitului rezultat.\n"

